 "summary": "Four glass-passivated diodes wired as a single-phase full-wave bridge in the small four-lead MBS (TO-269AA) surface-mount package. The three grades differ only in reverse voltage: 200 V (MB2S), 400 V (MB4S) and 600 V (MB6S). Each carries 0.5 A average output on a glass-epoxy board (0.8 A on an aluminium substrate), takes a 35 A half-sine surge and drops at most 1.0 V per diode at 0.4 A. Intended for general AC-to-DC rectification in supplies, lighting ballasts, chargers, appliances, office and telecom equipment.",
 "key_figures": [
